# From now on:
# ❌ Don’t do this:
# pip install -U <package>
# ✅ Do this instead:
# pip-compile --upgrade

# 👉 Let the resolver respect all constraints.

# NOTE on crewai: in the past, installing/upgrading crewai silently downgraded
# unrelated packages in this environment. crewai is pinned exact above for this
# reason — always run `pip-compile --upgrade-package crewai` in isolation (not
# a blanket --upgrade) and diff the resulting requirements.txt before applying.
